WEBVTT

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:04.650
The Golden Knight is 
definitely getting close.

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:09.230
That's fine. We don't have
to kidnap the "princess" that way.

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:11.530
I'm going to kill Gordon.

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:13.860
Will you help me do it?

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:17.320
I thought the same when she died.

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.160
But, if I die, who will remember her?

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:30.050
Monica!

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.800
How are things going?

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.050
Doctor Stanley.

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:43.020
The fusion experiment as well
as computerized control tests

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:45.600
are going exceedingly well.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.900
Make sure to make them tough.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:52.070
Looks like this is going
to be an extravagant stage.

00:01:02.490 --> 00:01:04.410
What's going on?

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:10.500
Wh-What's that?

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:21.930
It stinks to high hell! 
There's so many of them!

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:25.260
It's a whole battalion of Horrors!

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:40.740
How far are we from El Sanvados?

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:45.570
It's about 62 miles south southwest.

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:47.870
Right through the middle 
of that mountain range.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:52.040
Let's meet there. Take care of Sophie.

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:53.960
Got it.

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:56.670
Huh? What? What're you going to do?

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:01.920
Sophie. Make sure to listen to Gina.

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:07.390
Don't worry. I won't let
them lay a finger on you.

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:13.100
Sword!

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:19.260
Of course, that's how they would move.

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:30.370
Let me see how far the all-powerful
Garo can get against these numbers.

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:33.540
I'll be damned.

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:36.750
Looks like the enemy is going all out.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:40.750
Since they can't get you one-on-one,
they're going for numbers.

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:45.720
Trample down the Golden Knight
and take the girl our King desires!

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:51.000
Well, maybe not without
some injuries here and there...

00:04:56.100 --> 00:05:00.860
A massive-scale barrier, huh?
Pretty sophisticated for Horrors.

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:03.690
The stench is just going 
to build-up that way.

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:09.910
Well, then. Let's do some
massive clean-up, partner!

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:37.350
Gina! Go back! Sword is in danger!

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:40.310
Please! Help Sword!

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:41.320
Gina!

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:42.040
Be quiet!

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:17.660
See ya!

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:36.890
He's here.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:46.820
How about you just surrender?

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:52.530
We don't want to injure you.
Why not come with us quietly?

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:55.490
You both get it, right?

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:59.700
This is the end. Garo will soon die.

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:03.750
You don't want the Alchemist 
to die, too, right?

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:07.250
Get down!

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:14.050
No way that got him.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:25.730
Looks like the unruly wenches
really love being treated rough.

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:46.290
Hold on tight!

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:14.070
D-Did we get away?

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:20.870
Sophie, lay back your seat
and pull the lever behind you.

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:27.370
You don't have to try and aim.
Just keep shooting!

00:09:57.660 --> 00:09:58.740
Shoot!

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:06.910
All right!

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:22.640
You did a good job.

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:27.480
Gina!

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:38.110
Luke!

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:51.420
Luke!

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:53.380
Not bad, hot stuff.

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:55.890
Your timing is impeccable.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:58.470
Leave the rest to me.

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:55.230
Whoa...

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:59.440
The Land of Guidance must have
sent him to an excellent training ground.

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:02.860
The sky...

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:05.290
Looks like the Horror 
barrier has been broken.

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:10.540
El Sanvados is right beyond all of this.

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:20.420
G-Gina...

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:25.300
Looks like that's the boss.

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:26.430
My, my.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:29.350
If you had just surrendered,

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:32.180
I wouldn't have to bring out
something like this.

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:38.110
They distilled the power of Horrors
and infused it to a machine

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:40.900
so that it could still
be active in the daylight.

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:42.650
What crap.

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:06.260
Sophie!

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.520
Sorry for the trouble, Gina!

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:37.290
Luke, too. It's been a while.

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:48.850
Looks like we gotta do
something about this thing!

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:04.440
Zaruba! Sword! Is Sword okay?!

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:07.150
He doesn't look it,
but he's the strongest knight, Garo.

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:10.490
We're going to hide until this blows over.

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:33.930
Zaruba, are you okay? Does it hurt?

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:35.890
Just what do you think I am?

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:40.100
Sorry.

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:44.050
Well, once we reach El Dorado,
I'll have them give me an overhaul.

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:48.430
Don't know if they have
a place to fix me up there, though.

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:51.820
Sorry.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:59.970
I can't do anything.
All I can do is be protected.

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:07.950
Sword. Gina. Luke.
Even you, Zaruba. You're all beat up.

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:12.190
I wonder why they're targeting me?

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:17.310
All I wanted to do is find my brother...

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:25.020
Don't cry. Tears are useless things.

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:30.490
You did nothing wrong, Sophie.

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:35.990
Live according to
your beliefs and move forward.

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:38.650
Garo exists to protect that freedom.

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:43.400
No matter how much it hurts.
Even if we lose our lives.

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:46.000
We'll be sure to protect you.

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:50.130
So don't stop moving.

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:02.670
Sophie. Get on me.

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:18.160
I was wondering why we
were able to get through so easily.

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:20.750
They had one hell of a 
soldier waiting for us.

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:21.620
What'll we do?

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:25.580
Sword'll come after us.
We have to buy time until then.

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:57.880
Come, girl.

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:01.130
It is pointless to struggle further.

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:09.420
Sophie.

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:28.440
No matter what happens here on out,
don't stop moving forward.

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:31.350
Z-Zaruba?

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:39.070
Zaruba!

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:47.600
It was fun, partner.

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:59.240
Though a mere Madou ring,
that was a brilliant death.

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:07.080
To think it was able to injure me this much.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:13.170
Dark knight...

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:22.050
Zaruba...

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:34.190
Your will, by my side eternal!

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:55.790
So you absorbed the Madou ring
and gained further power.

00:19:57.630 --> 00:20:00.470
Wonderful! Come! I will test you out!

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:47.850
You are definitely worthy
of being my ultimate nemesis!

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:56.570
Prepare yourself for death,
the next time we meet!

00:20:57.900 --> 00:20:59.940
Until we both draw our last breath!

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:02.400
You bastard!

00:21:38.110 --> 00:21:41.860
So don't stop moving.
